{"id":"0b5415cbd96c5ae63f9b6b5a031c7b25019dd708","axis":"silent","repo":"TYPO3/typo3","sha":"0b5415cbd96c5ae63f9b6b5a031c7b25019dd708","parsed":{"files":[{"path":"typo3/sysext/core/Documentation/Changelog/15.0/Breaking-95823-PropertyAccessMethodsOfAbstractDomainObjectRemoved.rst","lines":["@@ -0,0 +1,89 @@","+.. include:: /Includes.rst.txt","+","+.. _breaking-95823-1790589493:","+","+==========================================================================","+Breaking: #95823 - Property access methods of AbstractDomainObject removed","+==========================================================================","+","+See :issue:`95823`","+","+Description","+===========","+","+The following internal methods have been removed from","+:php:`\\TYPO3\\CMS\\Extbase\\DomainObject\\AbstractDomainObject` and","+:php:`\\TYPO3\\CMS\\Extbase\\DomainObject\\DomainObjectInterface`:","+","+*   :php:`_setProperty()`","+*   :php:`_getProperty()`","+*   :php:`_hasProperty()`","+","+Extbase no longer reads and writes entity properties from inside the entity.","+The persistence layer accesses the entity from outside via reflection, using","+the methods :php:`getRawEntityPropertyValue()`,","+:php:`setRawEntityPropertyValue()` and :php:`hasEntityProperty()` of","+:php:`\\TYPO3\\CMS\\Extbase\\Reflection\\ReflectionService`.","+","+These methods work on the raw property values: property hooks, getters and","+setters of the entity are not called. Private properties declared in the model","+class itself are read, written and persisted as well, which was not the case","+with the removed methods. Private properties of a parent class are not entity","+properties. Virtual properties (property hooks without a backing value) hold no","+state and are ignored.","+","+..  important::","+","+    The new methods of :php:`ReflectionService` are marked as","+    :php:`@internal`. They exist for the persistence layer and are no","+    replacement API for the removed methods.","+","+Impact","+======","+","+Calling one of the removed methods results in a fatal PHP error.","+","+Property hooks of Extbase models are no longer executed while the persistence","+layer reconstitutes or persists an entity. Custom implementations of the","+removed methods in a model are no longer called by Extbase.","+","+Affected installations","+======================","+","+Installations with extensions that call :php:`_setProperty()`,","+:php:`_getProperty()` or :php:`_hasProperty()` on Extbase domain objects, for","+example to set the :php:`uid` of an entity in tests, or that override these","+methods in a model.","+","+Installations with Extbase models that rely on property hooks being executed","+when records are loaded or persisted.","+","+The extension scanner reports calls of the removed methods as weak matches, as","+it only matches the method names and cannot tell which class a method is called","+on. Models that override one of the removed methods are not reported.","+","+Migration","+=========","+","+Read and write the property with PHP reflection. This works with TYPO3 v14","+and v15:","+","+..  code-block:: php","+","+    // Before: $entity->_setProperty('uid', 42);","+    (new \\ReflectionProperty($entity, 'uid'))->setValue($entity, 42);","+","+    // Before: $entity->_getProperty('title');","+    $property = new \\ReflectionProperty($entity, 'title');","+    $title = $property->isInitialized($entity)","+        ? $property->getValue($entity)","+        : null;","+","+    // Before: $entity->_hasProperty('title');","+    $hasTitle = property_exists($entity, 'title');","+","+Logic that has to run after an entity has been reconstituted belongs into","+:php:`initializeObject()` of the model or an event listener for","+:php:`\\TYPO3\\CMS\\Extbase\\Event\\Persistence\\AfterObjectThawedEvent`.","+","+.. index:: PHP-API, PartiallyScanned, ext:extbase"],"additions":89,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"typo3/sysext/extbase/Classes/DomainObject/AbstractDomainObject.php","lines":["@@ -97,28 +97,6 @@ public function getPid(): ?int","         return (int)$this->pid;","     }"," ","-    /**","-     * @internal","-     */","-    public function _setProperty(string $propertyName, mixed $value): bool","-    {","-        if ($this->_hasProperty($propertyName)) {","-            $this->{$propertyName} = $value;","-            return true;","-        }","-        return false;","-    }","-","-    /**","-     * @internal","-     */","-    public function _getProperty(string $propertyName): mixed","-    {","-        return $this->_hasProperty($propertyName) && isset($this->{$propertyName})","-            ? $this->{$propertyName}","-            : null;","-    }","-","     /**","      * @return array<non-empty-string, mixed> a hash map of property names and property values.","      *","@@ -126,7 +104,8 @@ public function _getProperty(string $propertyName): mixed","      */","     public function _getProperties(): array","     {","-        $properties = get_object_vars($this);","+        // Read in the scope of the entity class, so its own private properties are included","+        $properties = (fn(): array => get_object_vars($this))->call($this);","         foreach ($properties as $propertyName => $propertyValue) {","             if (str_starts_with($propertyName, '_')) {","                 unset($properties[$propertyName]);","@@ -135,16 +114,6 @@ public function _getProperties(): array","         return $properties;","     }"," ","-    /**","-     * @param non-empty-string $propertyName","-     *","-     * @internal","-     */","-    public function _hasProperty(string $propertyName): bool","-    {","-        return property_exists($this, $propertyName);","-    }","-","     /**","      * Returns TRUE if the object is new (the uid was not set, yet)","      *"],"additions":2,"deletions":33,"truncated":false},{"path":"typo3/sysext/extbase/Classes/DomainObject/DomainObjectInterface.php","lines":["@@ -41,27 +41,6 @@ public function getPid(): ?int;","      